'''Halloween Party!''' (ハロウィンパーティ, ''Harowin Pāti'', '''Halloween Party''') is the Halloween event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]]. '''#01 Ghost Panic''' was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

==Event Information==
THE STARS HAVE ALIGNED! THE MOON IS FULL! HALLOWEEN IS HERE!

Limited stage All Hallows Road, special Rare Capsules and more are back for the spooky season!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from October 26th (11:00am) until November 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Limited Edition HALLOWEEN CAPSULES'''}}<br>
Featuring units decked out in gothic horror Halloween costumes!<br>
Plus, {{Color|#0000FF|'''Lilith Cat has had Talents unlocked'''}}!<br>
Tap the banner in the Rare Capsules to check the available lineup of characters and their abilities!

※Each of the above characters will be available only during this event.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Limited-time Halloween Party Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Use special Legendary Spirits to earn {{Color|#FF0000|'''Featured Items'''}} from the Event Capsules!

Featured Item(s): {{Color|#34A853|'''Platinum Shard (up to 2), Rare Ticket (up to 1), Cat Ticket (up to 1) , Leadership (up to 2) and 1,000,000 XP (up to 3)!'''}}

※ The Halloween Event Capsules can only be used with Legendary Spirits earned in-game.<br>
※Halloween Party Event Capsules will be unavailable after the event ends and collected Legendary Spirits will be unusable.<br>
※Extra Legendary Spirits cannot be converted into items or XP.<br>
※Once all Featured Items have been earned, they cannot be collected again.<br>
※If the Halloween Party Event Capsules do not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Limited Halloween Stages are back!'''}}<br>
Limited Halloween stages are available, and {{Color|#FF0000|'''clear rewards have been reset'''}}!

Get to Event Stages/Stories of Legend to take on All Hallows Road!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・ Stage 01: Ghost Panic! (Gauntlet) with Legendary Spirit rewards!'''}}<br>
Ghosts emerge from the dark of night to rampage into the morning!<br>
Reward(s): Legendary Spirit

※This stage can only be cleared a certain number of times before having to wait to begin the next one.<br>
※Catamin A can be used to immediately try a stage without waiting.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Stage 02: Sugar Struggle!'''}}<br>
Clear the stage for a small chance to collect the {{Color|#9900FF|'''Pumpcat'''}} unit!

Rewards include {{Color|#34A853|'''Rare Unit "Pumpcat", Rare Ticket'''}}, etc.

※ Using a Treasure Radar will give you a 100% chance of collecting Pumpcat!<br>
※If you have earned Pumpcat from a previous event, you will not be able to unlock it again.<br>
※Once you have unlocked Pumpcat, activate it by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Starting Day 8 of the event: Stage 03: Demons' Night Out!'''}}<br>
A costume party for your enemies?! There are 10 stages to complete, and each one comes with its own set of rewards to earn!

Reward(s): {{Color|#34A853|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket'''}}, etc.<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from October 26th (11:00am) until November 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

※Gauntlet Maps can only be cleared a certain number of times before having to wait to begin the next one.<br>
※ Catamin A can be used to immediately try a stage without waiting.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Starting Day 12 of the event: Tough Stage 04: Mischievous Schemes!'''}}<br>
Trick or treat! Powerful enemies have come to play cruel tricks on you!<br>
Do not fear the foes before you! Stand up and fight against their trickery!

Reward(s): {{Color|#34A853|'''Catamin A, Catamin B, Catamin C'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from October 26th (11:00am) until November 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Limited Missions and Login Stamps!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Halloween Limited Missions'''}}<br>
{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Login Stamps for 18 days to collect all available rewards!'''}}<br>
Reward(s): {{Color|#34A853|'''Rare Ticket, Cat Tickets, Legendary Spirit'''}}

※ Limited-time Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until the end of the event. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

